<title>USA: Vadnais Heights, Minn., $1.65 mln won by Piper.</title>
<headline>Vadnais Heights, Minn., $1.65 mln won by Piper.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc. said it won $1.165 million of Vadnais Heights, Minn., general obligation taxable tax increment refunding bonds, Series 12, with a true interest cost of 6.07 percent.</p>
</text>
